## Bot contact texts (ADR-0045, ADR-0050): errors on the contacts API and the
## reminder card in the bot's contacts page.

contacts-error-invalid-user-id = Not a complete Matrix user ID, or it is this bot itself
contacts-error-not-paired = The other user's server is not connected to yours
contacts-error-already-contact = You are already contacts, or a request is already out
contacts-error-bot-not-found = This bot is not installed anymore
contacts-error-contact-not-found = That line is already gone; another device may have handled it
contacts-error-not-keeper = Only the bot's keeper manages its contacts
contacts-error-peer-unreachable = Cannot reach the other server; try again later
contacts-error-unauthenticated = Pair this device with your server first, then open this from the app
contacts-error-upstream = The contacts change did not go through; try again later
contacts-error-unavailable = This server is not connected to Matrix, so bot contacts are unavailable
